@alife-records 1

node vp_1399.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Would clean up.. point to the place, don't need escorting
  t.any.2 Yes.. can the book wait somewhere away from the water?
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_HOUSE_BED
  t.any.1 Bed would be good.. don't want people gathering to see me use it
  t.any.2 Could rest there.. would like the book near my things
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_HOUSE_CHAIR
  t.any.1 Will take the seat.. less looking up at everybody
  t.any.2 Thanks.. can keep my own things beside me if that's allowed
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_HOUSE_LOCKS
  t.any.1 Would like them checked.. not telling you how to keep your own house
  t.any.2 Could look myself if you'd rather.. unknown doorways set me on edge
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_HOUSE_PHONE
  t.any.1 Ada's number first.. won't promise the call makes things easy
  t.any.2 Would try home in West Point.. might find somebody who knows where Ada went
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_HOUSE_PRAYER
  t.any.1 A quiet minute.. can manage the words myself
  t.any.2 Would like that.. doesn't need announcing to anybody else
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Could listen.. might hear something from Mount Washington
  t.any.2 Try it low.. easier hearing somebody else's voice that way
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 All right.. where would you rather the papers went?
  t.any.2 Thank you.. don't need the whole room cleared for me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  gate.rule trust>=15
  t.any.1 Pocket Bible.. Ada's blue writing inside.. stole it from her in ninety-one to sell.. nobody wanted the damaged thing.. kept it, told her I hadn't seen it.. that's the book against my shirt
  fx.1 reveal f_bible
  fx.2 set flag:bible_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d
  t.any.1 Small book and folded papers.. keep them out of the wet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d2
  t.any.1 Got a Bible.. don't want it passed round
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_COLD
  t.any.1 Cold.. jacket doesn't seem much use stopped here
  t.any.2 Something round the shoulders would help.. not too proud to ask
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_CRAVING
  gate.rule need:sick>=1
  t.any.1 Withdrawal.. need proper help, not somebody's guess at a cure
  t.any.2 Would like it to ease.. don't crowd me while I'm trying to answer
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_CRAVING.d
  t.any.1 Not ill with it this minute.. leave me a little peace about it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.any.1 Carried materials for years.. ask what I can manage before expecting it
  t.any.2 Could sort something.. don't want to promise heavy work before I know how I feel
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  gate.rule need:hunger>=2
  t.any.1 Hungry.. something small, let me manage it slowly
  t.any.2 Could eat.. don't need to be persuaded it's good food
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY.d
  t.any.1 Not wanting food right now.. don't take it for a complaint
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_HURT
  gate.rule trust>=45 & alone & flag:school_told
  t.any.1 Left leg.. broke it carrying roofing in eighty-six, that's why I was in hospital.. later employers don't know, afraid they'd stop giving me the carrying work.. could be other things need looking at now too.. would you check?
  fx.1 reveal f_leg
  fx.2 set flag:leg_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_HURT.d
  t.any.1 Would like somebody to look.. can't judge it all through a shirt
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_HURT.d2
  t.any.1 Don't want a crowd round while I'm checked
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Need to stop first.. try Mount Washington when I can
  t.any.2 Keep moving when I'm able.. would still rather stay in Kentucky
  t.any.3 Need to choose one next thing. Can't answer for the whole road
  t.any.4 Not decided. I don't need a crowd helping me decide
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_SICK
  t.any.1 Unwell.. withdrawal's part of it.. need someone who can check the rest
  t.any.2 Feel ill.. not something I'm going to talk out of being real
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY
  gate.rule need:thirst>=2
  t.any.1 Water.. would like to drink without talking over it
  t.any.2 Thirsty.. can ask that much plainly
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY.d
  t.any.1 Don't need water this moment.. can ask if that changes
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Could lie down.. sleep's been scraps rather than a whole night
  t.any.2 Tired.. don't need you standing over me to see whether I can sleep
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.lo.1 Want to.. not a comfortable answer
  t.mid.1 Enough to ask you to take my words without a whole audience
  t.hi.1 Yes.. don't need you pretending my old lies weren't lies
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.any.1 To be believed about what I'm asking.. not asking you to believe I never did wrong
  t.any.2 Hear me out.. would like that before you decide what help I deserve
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_NOW_WASH
  t.any.1 Would wash.. book needs to stay dry
  t.any.2 Yes.. sick of the shirt feeling like the road
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_OFFER_BLANKET
  t.any.1 Would accept.. don't mind what it looks like
  t.any.2 Yes.. can put it round me without being made a show of
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_OFFER_BOOK
  t.any.1 A western maybe.. something different from the book I've brought
  t.any.2 Could read a few pages.. no promises about keeping my place
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_OFFER_DRINK
  t.any.1 Water please.. something I don't have to explain choosing
  t.any.2 Would take a drink of water.. book can stay out of its way
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Could take some.. let me eat without questions if I do
  t.any.2 All right.. a little to start with
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_BOSS
  t.any.1 Pru Givens after I came out.. could see a crooked stack from across the site
  t.any.2 Roy Kellum on a later job.. hated music while he was measuring
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_CHILDHOOD
  t.any.1 West Point.. mother shouting from the kitchen when I got too far off
  t.any.2 Ada kept a garden.. got good at appearing after the digging was done
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.any.1 Mount Washington.. heard the warnings where I was staying
  t.any.2 At the room when the news began.. jobs stopped before I worked out where to go
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.any.1 Ada, my mother.. son Corey with Nancy last I knew, near Mount Washington
  t.any.2 Corey was born in seventy-eight.. no word from him or his mother now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Carrying sacks in West Point.. somebody always thought I could take one more
  t.any.2 Clearing a yard.. paid cash, spent it on a guitar string and supper
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  gate.rule trust>=75 & alone & flag:reference_told & imin>=60
  t.any.1 Guitar.. wrote a little tune for Corey when he was a baby in seventy-eight.. only ever played it for Nancy.. still remember it.. soft thing, don't want people laughing.. can tell you it exists without singing it here
  fx.1 reveal f_song
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d
  t.any.1 Played guitar.. didn't bring one with me
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d2
  t.any.1 Guitar when I could borrow one.. leave the songs alone
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_HOBBY.d3
  t.any.1 No singing for an audience.. don't want to be asked again
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Rented room.. not a house of my own
  t.any.2 Room in Mount Washington.. window stuck, never wanted the landlord in long enough to fix it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_LASTNORMAL
  t.any.1 Trying to find a guitar string without paying for a full set.. ordinary nuisance
  t.any.2 Ada sent potatoes with somebody.. didn't send a note, potatoes were the whole message
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_LOVE
  t.any.1 Nancy was my first wife.. married in eighty, divorced in eighty-one.. enough of that for now
  t.any.2 Was married.. don't want to make her life part of a room's conversation
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  gate.rule trust>=30 & flag:bible_told
  t.any.1 Nine school years.. left after ninth grade in seventy-five.. told Pru I'd finished high school when she hired me in eighty-five.. she didn't ask for proof.. didn't offer any
  fx.1 reveal f_school
  fx.2 set flag:school_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d
  t.any.1 School in West Point.. didn't stay to the end
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL.d2
  t.any.1 Nine school years.. don't need a lesson about the missing ones
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL
  t.any.1 West Point, Mount Washington.. round Kentucky for jobs, not much beyond it
  t.any.2 Been as far as Louisville.. never took a trip just to say I'd been somewhere
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE
  t.any.1 Burglary.. sentence from eighty-two to eighty-four.. can tell you the years without telling you every day
  t.any.2 Was in prison.. knew you'd likely ask, didn't make it easier waiting
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_WORK
  gate.rule trust>=60 & alone & flag:leg_told
  t.any.1 Labouring after prison.. got one job in ninety with a letter I wrote myself.. made it look like Roy Kellum's reference.. Roy hadn't seen it.. got the work, kept the paper.. still know whose name wasn't mine to write
  fx.1 reveal f_reference
  fx.2 set flag:reference_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_WORK.d
  t.any.1 Carried materials, cleared building sites.. after a burglary sentence, eighty-two to eighty-four
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_WORK.d2
  t.any.1 Labouring.. not giving you every employer with it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_PAST_WORK.d3
  t.any.1 Leave the old job papers out of this for now
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Thirty-three.. January sixty
  t.any.2 Thirty-three.. Ada still tells people the month as well as the year
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 Someone opening my book to check what sort it is
  t.any.2 A question asked louder because I didn't answer quickly
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.any.1 Strangers at the door.. hate not knowing how many are behind the first
  t.any.2 A knock followed by silence.. would rather they said what they wanted
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Ada's fried potatoes.. bits left crisp at the bottom
  t.any.2 Beans cooked thick.. bread to go with them, not fancy bread
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Mount Washington lately.. born in West Point
  t.any.2 Had a room in Mount Washington.. wasn't much, still had a key once
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Thumb along the book's edge.. rough where the cover went soft
  t.any.2 Turning the old pick in my hand.. didn't bring a guitar to use it on
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_HOPE
  t.any.1 Corey somewhere with people who know him.. don't know more than that
  t.any.2 Ada still complaining about the potatoes I leave too long in the pan
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Steve.. not looking for a crowd round me
  t.lo.2 ON EDGE.. sorry.. lower than that, I know
  t.mid.1 Can answer.. not all at once
  t.mid.2 Rather have a little space than a little speech
  t.mid.3 I'm giving you an answer. Please don't wait for somebody else's version
  t.mid.4 Could use fewer questions at once. Doesn't mean you did something wrong
  t.mid.5 Better when you let what I said stand till I change it
  t.hi.1 Don't want you making a good man out of every word I say
  t.hi.2 Glad you asked me instead of deciding.. that's all
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 Roy said a guitar wasn't a useful tool.. told him to try putting a tune on a shovel
  t.any.2 Ada called my room a pigsty.. said she'd never met such a tidy pig.. took me a minute to hear that right
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Guitar.. like getting a sound I meant to make
  t.any.2 Being given a job without a room full of people hearing why I need it
  t.any.3 A book I can put down without somebody asking why I stopped
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_MUSIC
  t.any.1 Guitar with somebody singing quietly.. hear enough shouting without music helping
  t.any.2 Ada used to say lower than that when I played.. liked listening till she wanted supper
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Steve Troutman.. Steve's enough
  t.any.2 Troutman.. don't use a nickname I haven't given you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_NERVOUS
  t.any.1 Yeah.. would be easier if people didn't stand too close
  t.any.2 Nervous.. voice gets ahead of what I want to say
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_PRAYER
  t.any.1 Some.. don't like saying it where people can judge the words
  t.any.2 Pray now and then.. having a book doesn't mean I've got an answer for you
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Good.. easier without every pause becoming a question
  t.any.2 Could stay quiet.. don't need you testing whether I'm still listening
  t.any.3 Please. You don't have to watch me being quiet
  t.any.4 Stay if you want. Just don't keep checking whether I've got more to say
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_SLEEP
  t.any.1 Hard to settle when I don't know who might come in
  t.any.2 Sleep's been broken.. wouldn't mind a room without people watching me try
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.mid.1 Pru had a radio tied up with wire.. everyone said it was finished.. moved it off the metal shelf and it started singing.. Pru made me carry it outside and back to prove I hadn't fixed it.. got music, not a raise
  t.hi.1 Ada wrote all her garden dates in blue.. remembered a frost by the ink she'd spilt that morning.. said she couldn't find the bottle again so it had better be her final frost.. she hated wasting a good colour
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_TALK_WEATHER
  t.any.1 Hope it stays dry.. book's had enough water in its life
  t.any.2 Never worked out rain by looking.. somebody on the job always claimed they could
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_WORLD_HOPE
  t.any.1 Think Kentucky can hold on.. don't want to go so far I can't find anybody I know
  t.any.2 Some hope.. hasn't gone just because I don't sound cheerful
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_WORLD_HOSPITAL
  t.any.1 Don't know who's still taking people.. would like somebody to find out
  t.any.2 No recent hospital news.. remember one from eighty-six, not promising it works now
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_WORLD_NEWS
  t.any.1 Warnings where I was staying.. haven't heard from anybody who's seen my family
  t.any.2 Heard jobs were stopping, then the other warnings.. didn't get a proper route out of any of it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.VQ_WORLD_ROAD
  t.any.1 Got through walking.. kept away from groups of stopped cars
  t.any.2 Can say where I passed, not where a car would get.. walked round the jams
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1399.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Enough.. would sooner be out of here
  t.any.2 Going.. don't want a last little argument to carry away
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1399.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Book with me.. can go
  t.any.2 Steve Troutman.. if somebody asks, you can give the name
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1399.react.gave_blanket
  gate.rule gave:blanket
  t.any.1 Thanks.. not turning down warmth to make a point
  t.any.2 Glad of the blanket.. leave me to settle it myself
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1399.react.gave_book
  gate.rule gave:book
  t.any.1 Thank you.. can find out what's in it without a room watching
  t.any.2 Will look through it.. glad you thought to offer reading
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1399.react.gave_food
  gate.rule gave:food
  t.any.1 Thanks.. food doesn't need a performance from me
  t.any.2 Appreciate that.. don't mistake a short answer for not caring
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1399.react.gave_water
  gate.rule gave:water
  t.any.1 Water's good of you.. thank you
  t.any.2 Will keep it clear of Ada's blue writing.. hadn't meant to carry the book through so much
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1399.react.insult
  t.any.1 Keep that SHIT to yourself
  t.any.2 You can stop now.. heard the ugly part
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1399.react.refused
  t.any.1 No.. heard it.. don't need everybody hearing it too
  t.any.2 All right.. asking didn't come with a promise you'd say yes
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1399.react.thanks
  t.any.1 Yeah.. you're welcome, didn't mean that so loud
  t.any.2 Glad I could.. won't pretend it made me anybody different
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1399.react.threat
  t.any.1 Wait.. can go without you hurting me
  t.any.2 Don't.. only want my own things and some space
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1399.return.arrive
  gate.rule visits>=1
  t.any.1 Steve back.. still got the book
  t.any.2 Troutman.. hoped there might be room to stop again
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1399.return.gave_food
  gate.rule visits>=1 & gaveever:food
  t.any.1 Didn't forget you giving food.. thought about that on the way here
  t.any.2 Your food was help I could take.. still grateful, even saying it badly
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1410.VQ_HOUSE_BATH
  t.any.1 Yes.. would like to get the road off my collar
  t.any.2 Glad of a wash.. can manage without somebody fetching every little thing
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_HOUSE_BED
  t.any.1 Would take it.. which room has somebody nearby?
  t.any.2 Yes please.. won't make a sales visit of asking for the bed
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_HOUSE_CHAIR
  t.any.1 Could sit.. will keep the horse out of anybody's way
  t.any.2 Thanks.. that's an offer I don't have to improve on
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_HOUSE_CHORES
  t.any.1 Yes.. what needs doing, not what ought to be done by a better man?
  t.any.2 Give me something small enough to finish.. like finishing things
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_HOUSE_LOCKS
  t.any.1 Would be easier knowing they'd been checked.. empty houses taught me to look at doors
  t.any.2 Please check.. don't want my worry deciding how you run the house
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_HOUSE_PHONE
  t.any.1 Would try Celia in Louisville.. ask for Owen after I knew it was her
  t.any.2 Celia's number.. don't know if a call could reach her, still know what I'd dial
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_HOUSE_RADIO
  t.any.1 Try it.. music would be welcome too, not only warnings
  t.any.2 Would listen.. could stand a voice with no interest in selling me something
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_HOUSE_WELCOME
  t.any.1 Thank you.. don't need to pretend I was only passing
  t.any.2 Inside would be good.. tell me if there's somewhere you don't want my things
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_CARRYING
  gate.rule trust>=60 & alone & flag:wedding_told
  t.any.1 Key, sales card, wooden horse.. old tie too.. hid a hundred eighty dollars of savings inside it during the divorce, told Celia I had nothing.. still carry the tie and the money.. you asked what I brought, that's what
  fx.1 reveal f_cash
  fx.2 set flag:cash_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d
  t.any.1 Room key and an old sales card.. small carving too
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d2
  t.any.1 Nothing I'd like passed from hand to hand
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_CARRYING.d3
  t.any.1 Can keep my things to myself, can't I?
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_COLD
  t.any.1 Could use something warmer.. shirt looked better in Louisville than it feels now
  t.any.2 Cold.. tie isn't doing much to help that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_HELP
  t.lo.1 Could sort or carry.. say what you need before I make a grand offer
  t.mid.1 Can help with a list, a small repair.. no good promising a roof
  t.hi.1 Give me one ordinary job.. haven't got a speech better than that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY
  gate.rule need:hunger>=2
  t.any.1 Would eat.. not planning to sell you my appetite
  t.any.2 Hungry enough not to be difficult about it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_HUNGRY.d
  t.any.1 Food can wait for now.. would still welcome something to do
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_HURT
  t.any.1 Feet have had a lot of road.. would be glad of a proper look
  t.any.2 Can't give you a clean bill by saying so.. something worries you, check it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_LISTENING
  t.any.1 Wondering whether somebody's coming.. keep thinking there ought to be a knock
  t.any.2 Listening for a voice.. silence from a whole house bothers me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_PLAN
  t.any.1 Head north when I can.. don't like the way every road brings me back to the same worry
  t.any.2 Stop, find a useful task, decide the route after.. in that order if it suits you
  t.any.3 No proposal ready. I mean no plan, not a proposal
  t.any.4 Need to choose something I believe, not something I can make sound attractive
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_ROAD
  gate.rule trust>=15
  t.any.1 Walked from Radcliff.. Orval McKee was walking with me.. promised to wait while he tried a shop, then left him inside.. wanted to choose my own road north.. didn't want the argument.. yes, left on purpose
  fx.1 reveal f_orval
  fx.2 set flag:orval_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_ROAD.d
  t.any.1 Walked from Radcliff after traffic stopped me
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_ROAD.d2
  t.any.1 Road was slow.. would rather not list every stop
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY
  gate.rule need:thirst>=2
  t.any.1 Thirsty.. plain water would suit me
  t.any.2 A drink would help.. water, if there's some to spare
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_THIRSTY.d
  t.any.1 Not needing a drink just now.. thanks for checking
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_TIRED
  t.any.1 Would rest if there's somewhere.. don't need selling on that
  t.any.2 Tired enough to stop planning the next mile for a while
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_TRUST
  t.lo.1 Enough to be here.. don't want to promise more than that
  t.mid.1 I think so.. still dislike not having an answer ready
  t.hi.1 Yes.. not an invitation to agree with every stupid thing I say
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_NOW_WANT
  t.any.1 Something to do.. would rather you didn't have to wonder what to do with me
  t.any.2 Want to be useful here.. can start small if that's easier
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_OFFER_BLANKET
  t.any.1 Would be grateful.. didn't dress for living on foot
  t.any.2 Yes.. doesn't have to match my very important tie
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_OFFER_DRINK
  t.any.1 Water please.. don't need anything special in it
  t.any.2 Could take water.. the simple answer for a change
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_OFFER_FOOD
  t.any.1 Would take food.. won't pretend I came with better provisions
  t.any.2 Kind offer.. not about to ask for a menu
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_BOSS
  t.any.1 Jasper Hale at the bank.. could wait a long time for an answer
  t.any.2 Sales manager before that kept telling me to enjoy rejection.. never saw him do it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_CHILDHOOD
  t.any.1 Louisville.. wanted a case to carry like Dad's neighbours going to work
  t.any.2 Kept bits of wood under the bed.. mother called them kindling, I had plans
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_DAYONE
  t.any.1 Driving toward Radcliff.. thought moving would make the warnings clearer
  t.any.2 Was in the car when the news got worse.. ended up leaving it and walking
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_FAMILY
  t.any.1 Son Owen.. born eighty-two, with Celia in Louisville last I knew
  t.any.2 Owen and his mother Celia.. divorced, doesn't mean I stopped wanting news of them
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_FIRSTJOB
  t.any.1 Insurance in eighty-one.. eighteen with a case and a borrowed tie
  t.any.2 Door-to-door sales.. found out how many ways a person could avoid answering a knock
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_HOBBY
  t.any.1 Woodcarving.. little animals for Owen, thick legs so they wouldn't snap
  t.any.2 Started with a horse.. Owen's wooden horse still needs finishing, apparently so does every horse I make
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_HOUSE
  t.any.1 Rented room lately.. before that, house with Celia and Owen
  t.any.2 Louisville room with a narrow bed.. landlord kept promising a wider one as if the room would grow too
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_LOVE
  gate.rule trust>=45 & alone & flag:miles_told
  t.any.1 Celia.. married in eighty-four, divorced ninety-one.. before the wedding I promised to quit travelling sales.. accepted another territory the day before, hid it two months.. not the wedding, it's that agreement I hate being asked about
  fx.1 reveal f_wedding
  fx.2 set flag:wedding_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_LOVE.d
  t.any.1 Married Celia in eighty-four.. divorce was ninety-one.. not the wedding, please
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_LOVE.d2
  t.any.1 Was married.. can leave the day itself out of it
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_LOVE.d3
  t.any.1 No more about the ceremony.. have other things to answer
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_MONEY
  t.any.1 Steady pay at the bank.. liked knowing the amount before Friday
  t.any.2 Insurance paid badly when I couldn't sell.. fixed wages suited me better
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_PARENTS
  t.any.1 Max and Verna.. Dad smoked, Mom hated how his papers got everywhere
  t.any.2 Verna could make Dad move with one look.. never learned that trick
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_SCHOOL
  t.any.1 Finished in Louisville in eighty-one.. wanted a wage more than another classroom
  t.any.2 High school.. thought I could talk my way into anything afterward.. got some doors shut on that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_TRAVEL
  t.any.1 Kentucky sales roads mostly.. Louisville to little towns, back for a clean shirt
  t.any.2 Radcliff on foot lately.. used to think walking was only for the distance between a parked car and a house call
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE
  gate.rule trust>=75 & alone & flag:cash_told & imin>=60
  t.any.1 Trouble I caused.. Elsie Rudd, teller and friend, borrowed twenty from her till in eighty-eight.. knew she'd already put it back.. told Jasper Hale anyway before he could suspect me.. Elsie lost her job, I kept mine.. don't call it doing my duty
  fx.1 reveal f_elsie
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d
  t.any.1 Never served time.. not the same as having nothing to tell
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d2
  t.any.1 There was a bank matter.. not with other people listening
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_TROUBLE.d3
  t.any.1 No.. not opening that up just to fill the quiet
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_WORK
  gate.rule trust>=30 & flag:orval_told
  t.any.1 Bank teller since eighty-seven.. insurance door to door before.. in eighty-six I invented trips on my mileage claim, collected eighty dollars.. didn't drive those miles.. liked being paid for them anyway
  fx.1 reveal f_miles
  fx.2 set flag:miles_told
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_WORK.d
  t.any.1 Bank teller.. sold insurance before I got tired of front steps
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_WORK.d2
  t.any.1 Had a little territory in insurance, then a place at the bank
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_PAST_WORK.d3
  t.any.1 Work's a fair question.. the old pay claims aren't for every listener
  tag.1 kind:deflect
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_ADVICE
  t.any.1 Don't buy something because the caller's embarrassed to leave without a sale
  t.any.2 If I start selling you an idea, ask what happens if you say no
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_AGE
  t.any.1 Thirty.. March sixty-three
  t.any.2 Thirty.. not young enough for everybody to excuse me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_DISLIKES
  t.any.1 Being told I'm a born salesman.. wasn't born knocking on anybody's house
  t.any.2 Empty rooms with a television still talking.. hated that even before this
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_FEAR
  t.any.1 Empty houses.. door open and nobody saying anything back
  t.any.2 Going through somebody's house without finding somebody in it.. don't want that
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_FOOD
  t.any.1 Roast chicken.. cold next day was fine too
  t.any.2 Celia made potato salad with too much mustard.. I miss it that way
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_FROM
  t.any.1 Louisville.. walked here from Radcliff
  t.any.2 Louisville born.. Radcliff was the latest stop, not home
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_HABIT
  t.any.1 Rolling paper between my fingers.. learned cigarettes for Dad, hands still do it
  t.any.2 Thumb rubs the wooden horse.. Owen's wooden horse, if I ever finish the legs
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_HOPE
  t.any.1 Owen still finding somewhere to put his ridiculous little horses
  t.any.2 A house where somebody answers from another room.. doesn't have to be my house
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_HOWARE
  t.lo.1 Brent Gentry.. available for.. well, not a sale
  t.lo.2 Doing better with a purpose.. got anything needs doing?
  t.mid.1 Don't much like waiting to find out whether I'm wanted
  t.mid.2 Trying not to make a pitch out of being here
  t.mid.3 Doing well. That's the voice I used at work; I can't quite turn it off
  t.mid.4 I'd like an answer that doesn't sound as though I'm selling you something
  t.mid.5 Better for not having to make a good impression every minute
  t.hi.1 Rather be useful than charming.. yes, I can hear how charming that sounds
  t.hi.2 I get touchy when I've nothing to do.. not blaming you for it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_JOKE
  t.any.1 Dad said insurance was the only thing I could sell without carrying it.. forgot about promises
  t.any.2 Carved Owen a horse.. he asked why it looked ready to sit down.. thick legs, no ambition
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_LIKES
  t.any.1 Woodcarving.. something small I can finish
  t.any.2 A shirt that fits at the collar.. spent my first wages finding one
  t.any.3 Somebody listening after it turns out I've nothing to offer them
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_MUSIC
  t.any.1 Radio country.. songs I can find again without knowing the singer
  t.any.2 Something cheerful.. don't require a song to understand me
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_NAME
  t.any.1 Brent Gentry.. used to put it on a card
  t.any.2 Gentry.. Brent, not Mr Gentry unless you're collecting something
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_NERVOUS
  t.any.1 Yes.. smiling doesn't settle that
  t.any.2 Nervous.. usually I'd have a reason to be knocking, a little territory to cover
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_QUIET
  t.any.1 Quiet's fine if I know somebody is there
  t.any.2 Can stop talking.. not much practice, but can
  t.any.3 Yes. Let's see whether I can leave that without a closing line
  t.any.4 Stay if you like. You're not obliged to be an audience
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_SLEEP
  t.any.1 Prefer knowing there's somebody in the next room.. don't need them talking
  t.any.2 Always slept worse in a room rented by the night.. wake thinking I've missed checkout
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_STORY
  t.mid.1 First insurance week I knocked on the same house twice.. woman asked if my mother knew I was out.. spent the rest of the day trying to grow a moustache by willpower.. never managed one worth keeping
  t.hi.1 Owen hid a carving in his school shoe once.. said it needed a stable.. Celia found it when he complained his foot hurt.. he'd kept the horse in there half the morning rather than spoil the game.. I laughed, she didn't
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_TALK_WEATHER
  t.any.1 Used to blame weather for a poor sales day.. could blame sunshine with a straight face
  t.any.2 Hope the road dries.. enough walking without mud taking a turn
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_WORLD_CITY
  t.any.1 Left Louisville.. don't know what it's like there now, and Owen was there last I knew
  t.any.2 Can't tell you the city's condition.. can tell you I want a message from it
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_WORLD_GUARD
  t.any.1 Haven't spoken to any soldiers.. saw uniforms from the road, couldn't tell you their job
  t.any.2 Saw people in uniform at a distance.. wouldn't know whether they were Guard
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_WORLD_HOSPITAL
  t.any.1 Don't know which hospital is taking anyone.. bank work didn't give me a private line
  t.any.2 No current word.. I'd ask somebody who'd actually reached one
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_WORLD_NEWS
  t.any.1 Heard warnings while driving.. never got a message from Celia out of any of them
  t.any.2 Nothing from anybody I know.. news was all places, no people I could find
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.VQ_WORLD_PLANS
  t.any.1 I'd stay where somebody answers.. after that, ask about the north road
  t.any.2 Find out who needs what before moving everybody.. no point walking for the pleasure of walking
  tag.1 kind:answer
end

node vp_1410.leave.angry
  t.any.1 Going.. don't need to agree before I leave
  t.any.2 Enough of this.. can keep the last word if you want it
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1410.leave.plain
  t.any.1 Brent Gentry.. name's yours to remember if you want
  t.any.2 Will go.. thank you for making room in the day
  tag.1 kind:leave
end

node vp_1410.react.gave_blanket
  gate.rule gave:blanket
  t.any.1 Thanks.. glad to accept something without arguing over the price
  t.any.2 Blanket's welcome.. fine clothes weren't much of a plan
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1410.react.gave_clothes
  gate.rule gave:clothes
  t.any.1 Thank you.. can stop being precious about a collar
  t.any.2 Glad of clothes.. appearance can wait behind having enough
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1410.react.gave_food
  gate.rule gave:food
  t.any.1 Thank you.. you've already done the useful part
  t.any.2 Food's kind of you.. hope I can help with something in return
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1410.react.gave_water
  gate.rule gave:water
  t.any.1 Appreciate the water.. no polished way to say that
  t.any.2 Thanks.. one thing I don't need to make complicated
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1410.react.insult
  t.any.1 Keep that damn opinion to yourself
  t.any.2 Don't like it, and don't need you improving the wording
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1410.react.refused
  t.any.1 No sale.. old habit, sorry.. heard the no
  t.any.2 Heard the answer.. disappointed, still heard it
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1410.react.sorry
  t.any.1 All right.. can leave it there
  t.any.2 I'll take the apology.. not promising to forget in a blink
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1410.react.thanks
  t.any.1 You're welcome.. that's all, don't need a bigger speech
  t.any.2 Happy to.. good to hear I was some use
  tag.1 kind:react
end

node vp_1410.return.arrive
  gate.rule visits>=1
  t.any.1 Gentry again.. no case of samples, just me
  t.any.2 Brent.. hoped being useful might still be an option
  tag.1 kind:return
end

node vp_1410.return.gave_food
  gate.rule visits>=1 & gaveever:food
  t.any.1 Remember your food.. didn't want that kindness lost under my talking
  t.any.2 You gave food.. kept meaning to say I appreciated it without making a pitch
  tag.1 kind:return
end
